      "content": "Grapefruit juice can interact with some medications, including atorvastatin. While drinking grapefruit juice has health benefits, such as containing nutrients, it may interfere with how your body processes the medication. It's important to discuss this diet change with your doctor—they'll provide personalized and safe advice on managing your cholesterol while taking atorvastatin.",
