      "content": "okay i'll try to cut back a bit then. but i've also been feeling a little more tired than usual and my muscles feel kinda sore/stiff lately... i assumed it was just from hitting the gym more since i've been trying to be healthy. that's just from the new diet or the vitamins right? it's not something serious from the statin?",
